\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Take my life, and let it be\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 At your service totally.
\par Take my moments and my days,
\par Let them flow in ceaseless praise.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Take my hands, and let them move
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 At the impulse of your love;
\par Take my feet, and let them do
\par Daily errands, Lord, for you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Take my voice, and let me sing
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Always, only, for my king;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Take my lips and let them speak
\par So that others Christ may seek.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Take my silver and my gold,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Not a mite would I withhold;
\par Take my intellect, and use
\par Every power as you shall choose.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   Take my will; it shall be yours,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Always subject to your laws,
\par Take my heart, it is your own,
\par \pard      It shall be your royal throne.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

